Subject: [PATCH] Backport registry node-pull image volumes to CDI v1.62.0
Upstream: https://github.com/kubevirt/containerized-data-importer/pull/4237
Upstream-head: 3cd7bfb4be7596205ef765445172729f2366380f (nav1s)
Base: kubevirt/containerized-data-importer v1.62.0

Test backport of the proposed upstream change, not a released upstream fix.
Mount the source image read-only in the importer and run the dependency-free
env extractor in the source image to preserve PVC label decoration.

Adapt to v1.62's transfer signatures, HTTP implementation and Bazel image
packaging. This release has neither bootc detection nor the later DataImportCron
node-pull poller. Do not copy source environment values to the importer log.

